## Promotion law

A checkpoint is `ALIVE` only when its runner, positive witness, negative falsifier, receipt verification, and detached clean-worktree replay all record exit code `0`, the evidence names a real git revision, tracked source is clean, every dependency is included by the release crown, and every implementation work item is complete enough to generate deterministic Jira and coding-agent contracts.
